{"explanation":"Classic Josephus problem. Counting starts from person 0, and every kth person is removed. Using the recurrence J(1)=0, J(i)=(J(i-1)+k) mod i for i=2..n gives the 0-based survivor label. This runs in O(n) with only numbers, does not mutate inputs, and always returns a finite integer Number.","code":"function solve(n, k) {
  var r = 0;
  for (var i = 2; i <= n; i++) {
    r = (r + k) % i;
  }
