{"explanation":"Iterate over the indices of the strings and count positions where the characters differ (Hamming distance). Uses only core ECMAScript, does not mutate inputs, and returns a plain Number. If lengths unexpectedly differ, it compares up to the longer length, treating missing characters as differing.","code":"function solve(a, b) {
